OL,3,A'Cruise for life' ship seized in
OL,4,ASingapore
OL,5,
OL,6,FAround 200 guests were forced to leave
OL,7,Fthe ship last month in the Cambodian
OL,8,Fport city of Sihanoukville, after its
OL,9,Fowner Villa Vie Residences abruptly
OL,10,Fsuspended operations citing
OL,11,F"extraordinary increases in fuel
OL,12,Fcosts".
OL,14,FThe crew onboard are reported to be
OL,15,Fwell, Singapore's port authority said.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
